<title>USA: Westco Q3 shr down to $0.04 vs $0.37.</title>
<headline>Westco Q3 shr down to $0.04 vs $0.37.</headline>
<dateline>WESTCHESTER, Ill 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.04		     0.37</p>
<p> Net		 107			1,056</p>
<p>			     9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.75		     1.11</p>
<p> Net		 2,130		    3,260</p>
<p>(All data above in '000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Westco Bancorp.</p>
<p>Quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>1996 and 1995 Q3 net income figures adjusted for three-for-two stock split in May 1996.</p>
<p>Decrease in Q3 earnings due to $1.6 million provision recognised in the quarter for the estimated amount of a special assessment. Provision offset by corresponding $624,000 decrease in income tax expense.</p>
</text>
